.TH GROW 1 "2026-07-13" "GROW 0.1.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
grow \- Git Repository Oriented Web runtime command-line interface
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B grow
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B grow
loads a committed GROW application from a local Git repository. Manifest,
static assets, and WebAssembly entry modules are read from the verified HEAD
tree, not from uncommitted working-tree files.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B inspect \fIREPO\fR
Print the application name, manifest version, verified commit ID, and runtime
entry configuration.
.TP
.B run \fIREPO\fR
Execute the WebAssembly runtime once with a GET request for / and print its
CGI-style response.
.TP
.B serve [--port \fIPORT\fR] \fIREPO\fR
Run the local HTTP daemon on 127.0.0.1. The default port is 7870.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -h, --help
Print command help.
.TP
.B -V, --version
Print the GROW CLI version.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I .grow/manifest.toml
Application manifest read from the committed repository tree.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Non-zero on invalid repositories, manifests, runtime failures, or server
startup errors.
